  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Switch to ignoring semver-minor updates by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2710\r\n* Bump actions/setup-node from 4 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2712\r\n* Ignore semver-patch updates in dependabot by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2716\r\n* wit-parser: reject duplicate record fields, flags and cases by @youdie006 in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2698\r\n* wasm-wave: Upgrade logos to 0.16.1 by @lann in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2718\r\n* wit-parser: reject flags with more than 32 members by @youdie006 in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2719\r\n* Fix some issues validating custom sections by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2720\r\n* Fix incremental parsing of component `start` section by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2722\r\n* Fix `read_var_s33` and handling in component defined types by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2723\r\n* Reject truncated nested modules and components by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2724\r\n* Fix validation of the key types of `map` by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2725\r\n* Tighten some feature gates in `wasmparser` by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2721\r\n* Fix disallowing borrows in streams/futures/values by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2727\r\n* Fix some custom-descriptors validation of dead code by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2734\r\n* Limit total components/modules in validation by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2730\r\n* Fix validation of tags in components by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2741\r\n* Release wasm-tools 1.261.0 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2738\r\n* fix incorrect async callback validation by @alexcrichton in https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/pull/2742\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-tools/compare/v1.260.0...v1.261.0",
